.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-session 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-session \- Read other agent sessions this one dispatched
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten session\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read other agent sessions this one dispatched
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
batten\-session\-watch(1)
Wait until a child session is done, dead or never started, from its transcript alone
.TP
batten\-session\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
